    "multicolumn_jRm6Nz": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_zkFDEV": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Trilogy-1.jpg",
            "title": "Public Programs",
            "text": "<p>By attending our public programs, tours, and special events, including our Speaker Series and Music at The Smith, you directly support The Foundation while connecting with a community of people who share a passion for Canadian art and children's art education.</p>",
            "link_label": "More",
            "link": "shopify://pages/public-programs-1"
          }
        },
        "column_b3AP4w": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/khimhipol240127_4172_be3eeb51-bd52-4b58-bb67-477204df46a3.jpg",
            "title": "Donations",
            "text": "<p>You can help ensure that children and youth continue to experience the joy, confidence, and curiosity that come from making and encountering art at the Gordon Smith Gallery and through Artists for Kids.</p>",
            "link_label": "Donate Today",
            "link": "shopify://pages/donate"
          }
        },
        "column_737Dgg": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/camp_smith_4_25.jpg",
            "title": "Brilliance Gala & Auctions",
            "text": "<p>The Brilliance Gala is a chance to come together to support a key facet of Gordon Smith’s legacy: quality, artist- and educator-led arts education for children and youth across the Lower Mainland through Artists for Kids.</p>",
            "link_label": "More",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_gnAgwn": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/khimhipol210921_7318.jpg",
            "title": "Smith Foundation Scholarships",
            "text": "<p>The Gordon and Marion Smith Foundation is pleased to offer three scholarships to graduating students from North Vancouver, West Vancouver and Vancouver, who have completed or are enrolled in Grade 12. </p>",
            "link_label": "More",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_MmkxYG": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/230705_brilliance_gala-0348-scaled.jpg",
            "title": "Endowment",
            "text": "<p>The Gordon and Marion Smith Foundation established a permanent endowment fund whose increasing annual revenues ensure the success and viability of Artists for Kids and their programs and support the Gordon Smith Gallery of Canadian Art in perpetuity. The Vancouver Foundation, Canada's largest community foundation, manages our endowment.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
